OL,3,GNEWSACall to restore asylum hotel to
OL,4,A'former glory'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader says he wants a hotel
OL,7,Fused to house asylum seekers to be
OL,8,Frestored to "its former glory".
OL,10,FThe Royal Hotel on Ferensway was used
OL,11,Fby the Home Office to house asylum
OL,12,Fseekers for more than six years, but
OL,13,FHull City Council confirmed on Tuesday
OL,14,Fthat everyone had been moved out of the
OL,15,Fhotel.
OL,17,F"This was once a grand hotel used in
OL,18,Fthe city for visitors for many years,"
OL,19,Fcouncil leader Mike Ross said. "It
OL,20,Fwould be a shame if that wasn't able to
OL,21,Fbe the case again for this hotel."
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
