OL,3,GNEWSACall to restore asylum hotel to
OL,4,A'former glory'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Home Office spokesperson said: "The
OL,7,Fconcerns of communities are central to
OL,8,Four immigration reforms. That is why we
OL,9,Fare closing every asylum hotel and
OL,10,Fmoving asylum seekers into alternative
OL,11,Faccommodation."
